DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppnnmmttiillee  reads  a PNM image as input.  It replicates it to fill an area
       of the specified dimensions and produces an image in the same format as
       output.

       You can do pretty much the reverse with ppaammddiiccee.

       You  can  explicitly  concatenate an image to itself (or anything else)
       with ppnnmmccaatt.

       If you're trying to tile multiple images into  a  superimage,  see  ppaa‐‐
       mmuunnddiiccee or (for a thumbnail sheet) ppnnmmiinnddeexx.



OOPPTTIIOONNSS
